cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pynonthermal, please cite it with the DOI of its Zenodo record. Please also consider a
  citation of the papers that describe the method, which are in the references.
type: software
title: pynonthermal
abstract: >-
  A Python solver for the Spencer-Fano equation. The equation describes the energy distribution of
  the non-thermal electrons that slow down in a plasma. pynonthermal computes the fractions of the
  deposited energy that go to heating, ionisation, and excitation, and the non-thermal rate
  coefficients.
authors:
